First, we will prepare our disk for installation. At least two partitions are
required to be present on the disk:
    - an EFI system partition
    - a root partition

If either of these does not exist, you can create them interactively by
following this step.

A general note on using this script: If you abort the installation process at
any time, you can restart at a specific step by passing its number to the
script as an argument, for example: ./syl.sh 4
